Cell["\<\
My calculation employs \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]http://www.xact.es/download/xAct_1.2.0.tgz\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] ; also,  see 
Cyril Pitrou
Institut d\[CloseCurlyQuote]Astrophysique de Paris (France)
pitrou@iap.fr
http://www2.iap.fr/users/pitrou/
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]FriedmannLemaitreMetric_CoordinatesApproach_xCoba.nb\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]
MyArrayComponents[expr_] := expr //ToBasis[BS] //ComponentArray //ToValues \
//ToValues //Simplify
\
\>", "Text",
